@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@attendanceId = replace-with-an-id-from-the-list-response

### Sign in as the System Administrator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "thabo.mokoena@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe-Dev-2026!",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### List today's attendance with summary counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance?page=1&pageSize=8

### Search and filter attendance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance?search=Kabelo&status=incomplete

### HR attendance report for a date range (maximum 366 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/reports?fromDate=2026-10-19&toDate=2026-11-17

### HR attendance report filtered to a department
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/reports?fromDate=2026-10-19&toDate=2026-11-17&departmentId=replace-with-a-department-id

### Review a record (replace the ID with one returned by the list request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/{{attendanceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledStart": "06:00",
  "clockIn": "05:54",
  "clockOut": "10:31",
  "status": "approved_exception",
  "reason": "Supervisor verified the original attendance scan."
}

### Updating an unknown record returns 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/attendance/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledStart": "08:00",
  "clockIn": "08:00",
  "clockOut": null,
  "status": "on_time",
  "reason": "Attempting to update a missing attendance record."
}
